                                                "sense_id": "1d1aa57d-2baf-3738-a20a-0654ee4f9ec8",
                                                "text": "1810, James Kennedy, Glenochel, Glasgow: R. Chapman, Volume 2, p. 118,\nProfoundly thoughtful looks the sage, / Barbigerous, and priestly mien’d;"
