                                                "example_id": "5aa15100-9d5a-4624-9521-b3ec7e2e80b1",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1aa57d-2baf-3738-a20a-0654ee4f9ec8",
                                                "text": "1972, Saul K. Padover, Karl Marx: An Intimate Biography, New York: McGraw-Hill, Chapter 20, p. 348,\nthe author magnificently barbigerous and the publisher elegantly bearded but bald"
                                            },
