                                                "sense_id": "1d1aa57d-2baf-3738-a20a-0654ee4f9ec8",
                                                "text": "[…] check out a portrait of the earl and you’ll see on his chin a barbigerous bulk that makes the poor fellow look like an Elizabethan cross between two Sams: Uncle and Yosemite."
